# Large processed data is stored with Git LFS.
#
# After cloning, run `git lfs install` once, then `git lfs pull` to fetch the
# actual files (see the "Prebuilt corpus" section in README.md).
#
# The vector store (~2 GB) is intentionally NOT shipped; rebuild it from the
# parquet with `python -m src.ingestion.embed_and_index`.
data/processed/chunks.parquet filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
